OraCare Cool Mouthrinse is a highly effective mouth rinse that goes straight to the root of the problem. As brushing and flossing alone are not enough to keep your breath fresh all the time, it is important to keep gargling mouthwash a regular part of oral hygiene. It has stabilized chlorine dioxide scientifically proven to remove strong mouth odors without the alcohol and sting! It neutralizes the main source of strong mouth odors by killing bad bacteria and tooth decay.
